# Kubernetes - SECURITY: Real kubeconfig must NOT be committed
# The file devops/kubeconfig is intentionally kept as a placeholder
# Fill it with your real kubeconfig on the target machine:
#   kubectl config view --minify --flatten > devops/kubeconfig
# devops/kubeconfig  <-- Uncomment this line to ignore the real kubeconfig after filling it
